---
import ServicePage from '../../components/ServicePage.astro';
---
<ServicePage
  serviceKey="corporate"
  seoTitle="Corporate Leasing and Selling in Ahmedabad"
  seoDescription="Lease or buy office space in Ahmedabad with City Property Services, from compact startup floors to full corporate buildings, with support to handover."
  eyebrow="Corporate spaces"
  heading="Corporate Leasing and Selling"
  intro="We help businesses find office space that fits how they actually work. From a first cabin for a young startup to a full corporate building, we match you with the right space, in the right location, on terms that make sense."
  lead={[
    "Every business is at a different stage, so the office that suits a four person team is rarely the one that suits a growing company of forty. We start by understanding your work, your people and your plans, and only then suggest spaces worth your time.",
    "Because we know Ahmedabad’s commercial pockets well, we can point you to areas that fit your budget, your clients and your team’s daily commute.",
  ]}
  helpItems={[
    "Office leasing and buying across Ahmedabad’s main commercial corridors",
    "Compact offices and managed seats for startups and small teams",
    "Larger floors for growing companies that need room to scale",
    "Full buildings and corporate houses for established businesses",
    "Shortlisting by location, size, layout, budget and lease terms",
    "Negotiation, paperwork and a smooth handover",
  ]}
  idealFor={["Startups", "Growing companies", "Established businesses", "Back offices", "Client facing teams", "Corporate headquarters"]}
  support={[
    { title: "Understand your needs", text: "We talk through your team size, growth plans, budget and how your office needs to feel before we show you anything." },
    { title: "Shortlist the right spaces", text: "You see a focused set of options that genuinely fit, not a long list that wastes your week." },
    { title: "Visit and compare", text: "We walk the spaces with you and weigh location, layout, parking, power and connectivity together." },
    { title: "Negotiate the terms", text: "We help you get fair rent or price, a sensible lock in, fit out time and clear conditions." },
    { title: "Close and move in", text: "We coordinate the documentation and handover so your team can settle in without the stress." },
  ]}
  ctaLabel="Find a Corporate Space"
  formIntent="Corporate"
  sizeHint="e.g. 8 seats, 2,500 sqft, or a full floor"
  relatedCategory="commercial"
  landingTypes={["office-space"]}
  faq={[
    { q: 'How much does office space cost to rent in Ahmedabad?', a: 'Across our {rentCount} current office listings, asking rents run from {rentRange}. Rates depend on the building grade, floor, furnishing and lock-in. Furnished and fitted floors in SG Highway, Prahlad Nagar and Thaltej sit at the top of the range; Navrangpura and Ashram Road offer older stock at lower rates.' },
    { q: 'Which areas of Ahmedabad have office space available right now?', a: 'We currently hold {count} office listings across {localityCount} localities, with the most choice in {topLocalities}. Each locality page below lists every current option with size and price.' },
    { q: 'What office sizes do you handle?', a: 'Current listings range from {sizeRange}, from compact cabins and managed seats for small teams to full floors and standalone corporate buildings. Tell us your headcount and growth plan and we shortlist only what fits.' },
    { q: 'What is a typical lock-in and deposit for an office lease in Ahmedabad?', a: 'Most commercial leases in Ahmedabad run 3 to 5 years with a lock-in of 1 to 3 years and a security deposit of 3 to 6 months’ rent, with an annual escalation clause. We negotiate the lock-in, fit-out period, escalation and exit terms alongside the rent, not just the headline rate.' },
    { q: 'Can you help us buy an office rather than lease?', a: 'Yes. {saleCount} of our office listings are for sale, from {saleRange}. We advise on the building, title and society documents, the fit-out condition and the achievable rental yield if you may lease it out later.' },
    { q: 'How do you charge for corporate leasing?', a: 'Brokerage is payable on a completed transaction only, on the standard Ahmedabad market basis. There is no fee for shortlisting, site visits or advice, and we tell you our terms before the first visit.' },
  ]}
/>
